## Contract gates

- [ ] Tenant and principal filtering before ranking/model use.
- [ ] No sensitive content in traces, logs or cache keys.
- [ ] Source and derived graph/multimodal evidence retain attribution.
- [ ] Access revocation and deletion propagate to every derived store.
- [ ] Corrupt or mismatched index manifests fail explicitly.
- [ ] Parser limits, cancellation, repeated work and backend outages are tested.
- [ ] Restore and atomic replacement do not resurrect deleted evidence.

